{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/001c7c57fb361101ecdebc83d6d24c0d.webp?t=1772510679\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras_big/001c7c57fb361101ecdebc83d6d24c0d.webp?t=1772510679 width=800 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/8a0f31085c6117ae9644d4fbe8722f2a.avif?t=1772510679\" width=800 height=130 /></span><strong><i>Overcome Your Fears</i> - </strong>is a psychological atmospheric horror game that immerses you in a world of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you are exploring the story of 19-year-old Steve Jackson, who takes a job house-sitting for friends while they are on vacation. What starts as a simple favor quickly turns into a chilling experience as unsettling events unfold in the quiet town. Little does Steve know, that these days will reveal dark secrets, and he must make choices that will change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/001c7c57fb361101ecdebc83d6d24c0d.webp?t=1772510679\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras_big/001c7c57fb361101ecdebc83d6d24c0d.webp?t=1772510679 width=800 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game primarily features a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and interaction mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/6ecbcce030c3ad294f543e1e1761cee0.poster.avif?t=1772510679\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/6ecbcce030c3ad294f543e1e1761cee0.webm?t=1772510679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/6ecbcce030c3ad294f543e1e1761cee0.mp4?t=1772510679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/001c7c57fb361101ecdebc83d6d24c0d.webp?t=1772510679\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras_big/001c7c57fb361101ecdebc83d6d24c0d.webp?t=1772510679 width=800 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror elements with unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialogues with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player voice activity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique sound effects that create tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/001c7c57fb361101ecdebc83d6d24c0d.webp?t=1772510679\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras_big/001c7c57fb361101ecdebc83d6d24c0d.webp?t=1772510679 width=800 height=25 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ERROR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni